ira Translator\" data-index=\"1\" jsaction=\"click:FixwAe\"><p><img src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP///////yH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" data-iid=\"i15\" data-deferred=\"1\" alt=\"Item media 2 (screenshot) for Mira Translator\"></p></div><div role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Preview slide 3 for Mira Translator\" data-index=\"2\" jsaction=\"click:FixwAe\"><p><img src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP///////yH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" data-iid=\"i16\" data-deferred=\"1\" alt=\"Item media 3 (screenshot) for Mira Translator\"></p></div><div role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Preview slide 4 for Mira Translator\" data-index=\"3\" jsaction=\"click:FixwAe\"><p><img src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP///////yH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" data-iid=\"i17\" data-deferred=\"1\" alt=\"Item media 4 (screenshot) for Mira Translator\"></p></div><div role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Preview slide 5 for Mira Translator\" data-index=\"4\" jsaction=\"click:FixwAe\"><p><img src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP///////yH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" data-iid=\"i18\" data-deferred=\"1\" alt=\"Item media 5 (screenshot) for Mira Translator\"></p></div><div role=\"button\" tabindex=\"0\" aria-label=\"Preview slide 6 for Mira Translator\" data-index=\"5\" jsaction=\"click:FixwAe\"><p><img src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIAAAP///////yH5BAEKAAEALAAAAAABAAEAAAICTAEAOw==\" data-iid=\"i19\" data-deferred=\"1\" alt=\"Item media 6 (screenshot) for Mira Translator\"></p></div></div></section><section><div><h2><p>Overview</p></h2></div><div jsaction=\"click:i7GaQb(rs1XOd);rcuQ6b:npT2md\" jscontroller=\"Tl2FDf\" jsname=\"ij8cu\"><p>Open-source &amp; secure webpage translation, YouTube bilingual subtitles</p><p>🌐 Immersive Translation · 🎬 YouTube Dual Subtitles · 🤖 AI Translation · 📝 Word Lookup\n100% Open Source · Privacy-First · Fast &amp; Lightweight\n\n🆓 Core Features (Completely Free)\nInstant web translation &amp; YouTube dual subtitles out of the box (enable the video's built-in CC button for subtitles). Powered by Google &amp; Bing.\n\n⚡ Advanced AI Translation \n\n Bring Your Own Key\nUse your own API Key from Gemini, GPT, Groq, Claude, and more. Fully local — no middleman, no data relay. We never sell or provide Keys.\n\n🎯 Custom Translation Zones\nUse the smart selector to highlight any area on any website. Saved per domain automatically.\n\n📚 Vocabulary Review\nDouble-click any word to look it up and save it. Saved words are auto-highlighted across all pages and YouTube subtitles.\n\n✨ More Features\n· Deep parsing of Facebook, Instagram, Twitter (X), Reddit, GitHub, and other complex sites\n· YouTube dual subtitles with live preview and one-click download\n· API Keys stored locally with WebDAV / Google Drive encrypted sync\n\nSource code: https://github.com/os9sur/MiraTranslator/</p></div></section><c-wiz jsrenderer=\"db7dHd\" jsshadow=\"\" jsdata=\"deferred-i20\" data-p=\"%.@.&quot;hmmllfdmkbmmfffjekhmmbhhfhhnocmn&quot;,null,true]\" data-node-index=\"2;0\" jsmodel=\"hc6Ubd\" c-wiz=\"\"><c-data id=\"i20\" jsdata=\" PM4Exd;_;2\"></c-data></c-wiz><section jslog=\"293312\"><P><h2>Details</h2></P><div><ul><li><p>Version</p><p>3.5.7.94</p></li><li><p>Updated</p><p>August 15, 2026</p></li><li></li><li><p>Size</p><p>358KiB</p></li><li><p>Languages</p><div><p>16 languages<span data-is-tooltip-wrapper=\"true\"></span></p></div></li><li><p>Developer</p><div><a href=\"https://os9sur.github.io/mira-trans/\" rel=\"ugc nofollow\" target=\"_blank\" jscontroller=\"R6rk4\" jsaction=\"click:AfbQdd\" jslog=\"293299; track:click,keyboard_enter\"><svg width=\"20\" height=\"20\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" focusable=\"false\"><path d=\"M12 2C6.48 2 2 6.48 2 12s4.48 10 10 10 10-4.48 10-10S17.52 2 12 2zM4 12c0-.61.08-1.21.21-1.78L8.99 15v1c0 1.1.9 2 2 2v1.93C7.06 19.43 4 16.07 4 12zm13.89 5.4c-.26-.81-1-1.4-1.9-1.4h-1v-3c0-.55-.45-1-1-1h-6v-2h2c.55 0 1-.45 1-1V7h2c1.1 